pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"zNPf2S_oNh_JJUWcoPo2uQ","review_id":"ZTkTpcpmtmIlRuIZLI_rkw","date":"2019-04-06T22:57:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9312977194786072,"text_excerpt":"I came here twice and enjoyed my experiences here. There is a small parking lot and street parking nearby, so parking has not been a issue for me. Walking into the restaurant, it is well decorated with a fire department theme. You walk up to the counter and place your order and can have a seat anywhere. So far I've had the Jack's Cheese Sticks, Meatloaf Po Boy, Hamburger Steak Special, Fries, Wednesday Special Crystal Fried Chicken, Hershey's Ice Cream and Java Jolt Rolled Ice Cream. The food took a while to come out during my first visit, but was lightning fast for my second visit. The Jack's Cheese Sticks were cheese sticks made in house with monterey jack cheese with homemade marinara ..."},{"business_id":"zNPf2S_oNh_JJUWcoPo2uQ","review_id":"4-xOfvziytavbE5pI2Vrkg","date":"2019-06-27T00:32:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.929105818271637,"text_excerpt":"This place is totally cute. It's hidden away in a corner of other businesses on Harrison avenue. I loved the decor. The restaurant has a nice comfy feel to it. The owner was so attentive and friendly. So you order your food and take a seat. They bring the food out to you. I had the Gentilly Philly. It consists of roast beef and Monterey Jack cheese. It also has sautéed mushrooms and onions. It was da bomb. I loved the Béchamel sauce. It was a nice touch. The French fries were also pretty yummy. Very crispy. The service was good. They also have desserts that consist of rolled ice cream, shakes, malts and bread pudding. I will be back to try the other menu items soon!!"},{"business_id":"zNPf2S_oNh_JJUWcoPo2uQ","review_id":"L153xu3bNArskuj6JUsqMQ","date":"2019-02-25T00:10:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9250611662864685,"text_excerpt":"YUM! Great food! The hamburger on a potato bun was amazing and I will be back for it. Homemade pickles were delicious, as were the sweet potato bites with powdered sugar. Great service too. A nice family run restaurant that leaves you feeling good about eating local!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"zNPf2S_oNh_JJUWcoPo2uQ","photo_id":"bHDs4SxK5hC3p-evRsLkdg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/bHDs4SxK5hC3p-evRsLkdg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8498120307922363},{"business_id":"zNPf2S_oNh_JJUWcoPo2uQ","photo_id":"L0jxSNIM2q_POpRgc7WDMg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/L0jxSNIM2q_POpRgc7WDMg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7640512585639954},{"business_id":"zNPf2S_oNh_JJUWcoPo2uQ","photo_id":"zwaThOIPFdSeduFOomgpsA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/zwaThOIPFdSeduFOomgpsA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7336777448654175},{"business_id":"zNPf2S_oNh_JJUWcoPo2uQ","photo_id":"VJaRrjivNhO6hw401at-Bw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VJaRrjivNhO6hw401at-Bw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7273743152618408}]},"notebook_case":null}
